WEBVTT

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:32.097
And now everyone's dazed and confused,
our greys turned to blues.

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:33.730
I'm off all of the socials,

00:07:33.763 --> 00:07:35.330
but I stay glued to the news

00:07:35.363 --> 00:07:38.063
because I'm watching the paint dry

00:07:38.097 --> 00:07:41.330
that will not dry fast enough
for me to keep going.

00:07:44.430 --> 00:07:45.597
Hmm.

00:07:47.163 --> 00:07:48.663
Skip to the summer.

00:07:48.697 --> 00:07:49.897
Skip to the summer,

00:07:50.830 --> 00:07:52.163
now the country's on fire.

00:07:54.063 --> 00:07:55.797
I'm back on all the socials,

00:07:57.463 --> 00:08:02.930
because my one-man show has been
revived and revamped for the virtual space